        "emoji": "\ud83d\udd27"
      },
      {
        "repo": "codejson-schemas",
        "text": "Expanded and refined the exemption enum taxonomy: the old `exemptByLaw` was split into `exemptByNationalSecurity`, `exemptByNationalIntelligence`, `exemptByFOIA`, `exemptByEAR`, `exemptByITAR`, `exemptByTSA`, and `exemptByClassifiedInformation`; the old `exemptByNationalSecurity` (covering national security, confidentiality, _and_ individual privacy risk) was split so privacy risk became its own value, `exemptByPrivacyRisk`; `exemptByIPRestriction` was also added.",
        "category": "Changed",
        "emoji": "\ud83d\udd27"
      },
      {
        "repo": "codejson-schemas",
